 "notes": [
  {
   "text": "BUILDING GENERATOR  (bldg::building_generator::1.0)\nModules read only OUT_* nulls and HDA parms (ch(\"../name\")). Data flows top -> bottom.\nFOOTPRINT: prim 0 = ground outline, prim 1 = upper outline (jetty). WING_PLAN: one polygon per wing.\nLAYOUT: one point per bay (main + wings): s@module W0 W D S WA DA WR, i@floor i@edge i@bay i@nbays i@poly\n  f@bay_width, orient, scale. Each MOD_<T> builds ONE bay in module space and is copied onto its points.\nRow 2 modules add volumes, roofs, overlays (timber, buttress) and attachments (canopy, balcony, tower).\nOutput prims: s@mat_id s@part v@Cd s@unreal_material, vertex uv + N. Outputs: 0 selected, 1 LOW, 2 HIGH.\nHIGH = LOW + PolyBevel on parts listed in 'HIGH Bevel Parts' (walls / roof planes stay flat for Substance).\nSource of truth: <project>/tools/hbuild/generators/building (do not hand-edit VEX only here).",
   "pos": [
    -2.0,
    5.5
   ]
  }
 ]
